## clean-room-v1 lexica

- Status: this repository no longer ships HurtLex. HurtLex's actual license
  is CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 (NonCommercial), never CC-BY-SA-4.0 as an earlier
  version of this file claimed. The NonCommercial term is the reason this
  project built its own lexica from scratch. `data/raw-v1/hurtlex/` and
  `data/hurtlex/` are deleted, and no HurtLex bytes remain in this
  repository or in any built artifact.
- The fifteen lexica under `data/clean-room-v1/` replace HurtLex. Each is an
  independent work assembled from the sources below, reviewed lemma by
  lemma against the project's own category scheme. Share-alike survives
  this change: it now runs against Wiktionary, not HurtLex.

