## Model artifacts

The training sources are recorded in `resources/datasets/source-lock-v1.json`.
The model artifacts under `resources/models/` are weight tables trained on
the corpora above. They contain no corpus text, but each is a derivative
work of its training data and inherits that data's license.

The Korean artifact, `resources/models/multilingual-v2/ko-sparse-v2.bin`,
trains in part on k-mhas data (CC-BY-SA-4.0, share-alike, see above). This
artifact carries that share-alike obligation. Any redistribution of it, or of
any artifact trained on k-mhas, must carry the CC-BY-SA-4.0 license and
attribution.
